<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">stillwater-pearl-pendant</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A small dark stillwater pearl set in a fine silver bezel, hung on
a delicate chain. The pendant carries a quiet weight on the throat
and lends the wearer a measure of magical resilience at a small
cost to the conviction pool that sustains it.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 30)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> stillwater pearl (x1), silver wire (x2),
                 chain link (x1)

